1315
01:30:27,580 --> 01:30:28,750
Midwives!

1316
01:30:28,830 --> 01:30:29,950
Exactly.

1317
01:30:30,040 --> 01:30:31,370
They're not doctors.

1318
01:30:32,080 --> 01:30:33,200
